  "_readme": [
    "One row per campaign in assets/data.js, keyed by the same slug.",
    "",
    "videoId       — the brand's own upload. Pinned = 1 quota unit and zero guesswork.",
    "officialChannel — the channel title that must match for a live count to be trusted.",
    "                  Third-party re-uploads carry a fraction of an ad's real reach, so",
    "                  an unverified match is reported but never allowed to overwrite the",
    "                  editorial estimate in assets/data.js.",
    "skipResolve   — true where the brand's own upload no longer exists or is unlisted.",
    "                Checked by hand on 2026-07-28: searching the brand's own channel",
    "                returns nothing for these. Stops the resolver burning 100 quota",
    "                units a day looking for a video that is not there. If a brand",
    "                re-uploads, set videoId and flip this to false.",
    "metaPage      — the Facebook Page name to look up in the Meta Ad Library.",
    "origin — where the campaign was made. Drives the globe markers and the country grouping on the sign-in screen."
